  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learning Coin for Equitable Education (Phase 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the completion of Phase 1 in 2021, the Learning Coin for Equitable Education (Phase 2) project will continue to promote literacy and cultivate reading habits of out-of-school and marginalized children and youth (focusing on non-formal education learners) in Thailand through mobile learning and conditional cash transfer. In addition to the existing four target provinces, the project will be expanded in two new provinces to support children and youth to achieve better learning outcomes and economically assist their families with scholarships based on their monthly reading performance. The target learners will also develop ICT skills through mobile learning and capacity building.</narrative>
  </description>
